				<center>
					<p class="roboto" style="color:#636363;font-size:18px">Panorama Organic Farmer Daniel Sinton</p>
				</center>
				<p>Daniel shares gorgeous views of his ranch, which comprises 18,000 acres of open range land, and explains the life cycle of his herds.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
